{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A skill based game with lots of customizability, where you slash bullets with a sword before they hit the ground, to earn money and get new cosmetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the play button is pressed bullets will fall down from the top of the screen, you must hit them with your sword before they hit the ground or you will die and have to start over. There are three different spots the bullets can spawn at, each one corresponds with a certain attack. If the bullet spawns on the left you must hit it with a left slash. If it spawns on the right you must hit it with a right slash. If it spawns in the middle you must hit it with a stab. Each bullet you strike you will get a point and cash. You can buy cosmetics with cash. The more points you have the more often bullets will spawn, and they will have a higher max speed. Try to get the highest score you can.\u00a0</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Viridescent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3880820/710873bcbabe850a4dcf7e300f6771bfee703e5d.jpg"},{"name":"Cerulean","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3880820/34e53f4e80a1f28e29ca9f6032ce3111aed82fc5.jpg"},{"name":"Bloodlust","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3880820/97eb1ebbaaa04b40dcb9ab47b2b3e2c1a3229e9d.jpg"},{"name":"Venom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3880820/414de9420dfcb22a5f26351c2ed5bda466f6b905.jpg"},{"name":"Kingslayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3880820/19d4aff5790447b85b14a750622015b542f18a66.jpg"},{"name":"Shadow","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3880820/95c31d6baf37dd7cec3c79f00d7117a823154721.jpg"},{"name":"Twin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/38808